ntainment and as  you have probably predicted andy mcguire  finds himself doused in energy now not  only does he survive much to the  surprise of everybody watching but he  immediately manifests superhuman  abilities as he creates a force field to  shield his classmates from falling  debris now naturally andy's parents hire  attorneys and they threaten horizon labs  with a lawsuit for nearly killing their  son but the lab brings in the world's  foremost experts in studying superhumans  reed richards tony stark hank pym and  hank mccoy also known as beast all of  whom are basically there to try to find  a solution now in the examination of  andy maguire they find that every cell  in his body has been permeated by the  parker particles and that they  constantly charge and recharge to  provide him a variety of superhuman  abilities in their assessment they  determined that andy's list of powers  include energy projection super strength  super speed and flight pretty much  run-of-the-mill stuff for any superhero  furthermore they discovered that andy is  only able to use one of these powers at  a time so for instance he cannot fly and  use energy projection at the same time  he can only do one or the other but  here's where things get interesting  because undoubtedly asking yourself how  in the world does the ability to fly and  punch hard make this guy beyond omega  level patience rob core patience so  here's where things get interesting as  reed richards tells peter that over time  andy's powers will continue to grow this  is because they are tied to the universe  itself and the universe is constantly  expanding reed even says that while the  hulk the century and the phoenix force  are designated as omega level threats  that andy goes beyond that and will  eventually become the first ever alpha  level threat which doesn't really make  sense from a naming perspective because  alpha comes before omega in the greek  alphabet and also when clarifying  mutants alpha level mutants are already  a thing and they're not as powerful as  omega level mutants but whatever the  point is that andy mcguire is stated to  be beyond an omega level threat so we  don't even have to debate whether or not  he belongs on this list because we know  he does marvel told us he does  and the fact that he will one day  surpass the phoenix force really lets us  know that he's one of the biggest  threats the marvel universe has ever  seen now because he's so powerful and  because peter parker is partially to  blame for him existing it's decided that  spider-man will be responsible for  training andy furthermore to avoid a  lawsuit horizon labs agrees to a  lucrative contract for andy to be a  spokesman for them which leads to him  becoming a superhero and adopting the  name alpha now peter parker who is  believed to be an associate of  spider-man among other things makes his  suits and stuff like that is basically  put in charge of making a suit for alpha  but he foolishly does not include a mask  meaning that the whole world knows  alpha's real identity this means that  back at school andy mcguire is now the  big man on campus and of course all the  fame and popularity goes to his head and  turns him into just a ridiculous dick  now when the fantastic four and  spider-man encounter a monster named  giganto their combined efforts proved to  be insufficient to defeat him despite  being told of course to stay out of the  conflict alpha comes to their aid and  defeats giganto with one punch  officially making him one punch man but  as the press gathers around alpha  declares that he is on his way to  joining the avengers and that spider-man  has been designated his sidekick and so  all the heroes have basically figured  out that at this point alpha's gonna be  a problem now alpha continues to become  an increasingly horrible human being and  he his family his lawyer and a girl that  he was cheating on his girlfriend with  are all kidnapped by the jacqueline who  clones alpha but the clones don't have  alpha's power since his dna was not  actually altered now after being rescued  alpha kills his clones and decides he's  had enough of being mentored and moves  to new york to increase his celebrity  status this of course leads to peter  parker to decide that something has to  be done about this guy so as peter  searches for a way to rid alpha of his  powers the earth is attacked by a  villain named terminus but this guy  draws the attention of the avengers  including thor captain marvel vision  iron man and captain america and even  with all that power they're unable to  defeat terminus naturally of course they  turn to the biggest weapon they have  which happens to be alpha who shows up  and starts pelting terminus with energy  blasts now even though this is effective  in defeating terminus the energy that's  deflected in battle knocks several  planes out of the sky including one with  aunt may on board because you know  what's a spider-man story if aunt may's  life not in jeopardy of course  spider-man saves aunt may and then also  takes some of the tech that terminus  used to deflect alpha's attacks and  figures out a way to drain alpha of his  energy which basically depowers him and  forces him to go back to his old life as  a nobody at midtown high now later after  otto octavius switches bodies with peter  parker he decides to give alpha 10 of  his power back under the pretense of  giving alpha a second chance to prove  himself worthy of being a superhero but  in reality it was an attempt to  basically harness the power for himself  which you would expect because dr  octopus is nothing if not a dick so the  story that follows this is pretty  unremarkable if i'm being honest but the  one thing we do learn from it is that  alpha has a power not previously  mentioned which is matter manipulation  and if you've followed our beyond omega  level series you'll probably recognize  that this is a very common power for  beyond omeg